# Quick Reference

## Frontend (`frontend/`)

```bash
npm run dev      # http://localhost:3000
npm run build
npm run start
npm run lint
```

## Backend (`backend/`)

```bash
cd backend
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload   # http://localhost:8000
uv run python -c "from app.main import app"
```

## Supabase

```bash
supabase migration new <name>
supabase db push
supabase db reset
supabase start    # Postgres :54322, API :54321, Studio :54323
supabase gen types typescript --linked > frontend/src/types/supabase.ts
```

## Key paths

| What | Where |
|------|-------|
| PRD | `PRD_claude.md` |
| Project guide | `CLAUDE.md` |
| Next.js 16 notes | `frontend/AGENTS.md` |
| Session middleware | `frontend/src/proxy.ts` |
| Auth actions | `frontend/src/app/(auth)/actions.ts` |
| Supabase clients | `frontend/src/lib/supabase/` |
| Public form | `frontend/src/app/f/[slug]/` |
| LangGraph graph | `backend/app/pipeline/graph.py` |
| Definition schema | `backend/app/schemas/definition.py` |
| Migrations | `supabase/migrations/` |
| DB types | `frontend/src/types/supabase.ts` |

## Environment variables

**Frontend (`frontend/.env.local`):**

- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- `SUPABASE_URL` (server)
- `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` (server only — never expose to client bundles)

**Backend (`backend/.env` — see `.env.example`):**

- `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
- `SKETCHES_BUCKET=sketches`
- `LLM_PROVIDER`, `OPENAI_API_KEY` (and/or GitHub Models vars)
- `CORS_ORIGINS` (JSON array)
- `LOG_LEVEL`
- `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET` (optional legacy HS256)

